  <h1>Refund policy</h1>
  <p>This page explains how refunds work for ColoringPageMaker Pro. It says the same as the refunds section of our <a href="/terms">terms of use</a>.</p>

  <h2>What Pro costs</h2>
  <p>Pro is $9 (US dollars), paid once. It is not a subscription, so nothing renews and there is nothing to cancel. The free version of the site needs no payment.</p>

  <h2>14-day refund</h2>
  <p>If Pro does not work for you, email us within 14 days of purchase and we will refund you.</p>

  <h2>How to ask for a refund</h2>
  <p>Write to <a href="mailto:info@peakappsstudio.com">info@peakappsstudio.com</a> from the email address you used for the purchase and say that you would like a refund.</p>

  <h2>How you are paid back</h2>
  <p>Our order process is conducted by our online resellers Paddle.com and Gumroad. They are the Merchant of Record for all our orders, handle payment, sales tax/VAT and refunds, and their own terms also apply to your purchase. Refunds are paid back through the reseller you paid.</p>

  <h2>After a refund</h2>
  <p>A refunded license key can no longer turn Pro on.</p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>Questions about refunds: <a href="mailto:info@peakappsstudio.com">info@peakappsstudio.com</a>. ColoringPageMaker is run by Peak Apps Studio. How we handle your data is explained in our <a href="/privacy">privacy policy</a>.</p>
</article>
